  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/10"/><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/1"/>Fear Adonoy, [you] His holy ones,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/2"/>for those who fear Him suffer no deprivation.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/11"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/3"/>Young lions may feel want and hunger,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/4"/>but those who seek Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/5"/>will not be deprived of any good thing.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_1"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/6"/>Give thanks to Adonoy, for He is good,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/7"/>for His kindness endures forever.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_2"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/8"/>You open Your hand
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/9"/>and satisfy the desire of every living being.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_3"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:jeremiah/17/7"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/10"/>Blessed is the man who trusts in Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/11"/>so that Adonoy is his security.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_4"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/37/25"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/12"/>I was young and I have grown old,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/13"/>yet I have never seen
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/14"/>a righteous man forsaken,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/15"/>nor his children begging for bread.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_5"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/29/11"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/16"/>Adonoy will give strength to His people,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkat_hamazon/yiru_et_adonai/17"/>Adonoy will bless His people with peace.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_6"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
